[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0010","text":"哇……好厉害！\n吸血鬼……还有弗兰肯斯坦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0020","text":"呵呵……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0030","text":"你们两个，在聊什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0040","text":"看这个——！\n夏叶酱也来看看？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0050","text":"哦……！\n万圣节派对特辑……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0060","text":"每个扮装都好厉害啊，好专业……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0070","text":"呵呵，是呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0080","text":"尤其是这个魔女的服装，\n设计也很讲究，好漂亮呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0090","text":"是吧——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0100","text":"呵呵……\n不愧是……夏叶小姐……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_02_0003","text":"Motion"}]
